<title>JAPAN: Sanyo Electric - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Sanyo Electric - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		    six months		   four months</p>
<p> Sales		883.34		vs	  513.36</p>
<p> Operating	   30.37		vs	   13.50</p>
<p> Pretax		19.53		vs	    3.49</p>
<p> Net	     prft 8.17		vs     loss 3.74</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 4.19 yen	  vs     loss 1.92 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanyo Electric Co Ltd's comparison above</p>
<p>is figures for the last full business term which had</p>
<p>only four months. Half-term result for that business</p>
<p>term were not available.</p>
</text>
